      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Replaces Palengke Online among the three day-one Matches (decided 2026-11-17). Only Nordhavn's own row changes: it offers freight, wants two Kalayaan offers and sits in Quezon City, giving Fit Score 92."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_02_export_story_and_basics_before_claim_export_shipment_deal",
      "label": "First export shipment of banana chips to Europe",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": ".scratch/pilot-preview/issues/02-export-story-and-basics-before-claim.md",
