      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Kalayaan and Nordhavn connect on Day 1, confirm 'We met', and both confirm 'We did business' on Day 13, with Kalayaan's Testimonial on the Success Wall."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_02_export_story_and_basics_before_claim_dated_wins_and_deals",
      "label": "Dated wins and deals (CHAMBER_DEALS)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".scratch/pilot-preview/issues/02-export-story-and-basics-before-claim.md",
      "source_location": "L87",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "A win shows only from the day it was posted; the wall is empty on Days 0 to 2; by Day 14 the chamber has three confirmed deals and two wins; teamData counts from this data instead of a formula. Read through successWall(), winsOf() and dealsConfirmed()."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_02_export_story_and_basics_before_claim_basics_only_rule",
      "label": "Basics only before a Claim (publicView)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".scratch/pilot-preview/issues/02-export-story-and-basics-before-claim.md",
      "source_location": "L92",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Until a Company claims, others see only its name, industry, city, website and a 'Not yet claimed' mark; description, offers and needs wait for the Claim; the name is never hidden."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_02_export_story_and_basics_before_claim_match_reason",
      "label": "One-line reason from the viewer's side (matchReason)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".scratch/pilot-preview/issues/02-export-story-and-basics-before-claim.md",
      "source_location": "L92",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "'You're looking for {need}. {Name} works in {industry}, {city}.' or 'You offer {offer}. ...'; never contains the other Company's unpublished offers or needs."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_02_export_story_and_basics_before_claim_waiting_for_claim",
      "label": "Message waiting for a Claim (waitingForClaim)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".scratch/pilot-preview/issues/02-export-story-and-basics-before-claim.md",
      "source_location": "L93",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Connect is not offered for an unclaimed Company; a message waits with 'Waiting until {Name} claims its profile', gets no reply, and the waiting state is readable from the seam for the chamber view."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_02_export_story_and_basics_before_claim_two_weeks_seed_day_14",
